## 1. Systemd Service Diagnostics

### Step 1: Check Service Status

```bash
sudo systemctl status kubelet
```

### Step 2: Inspect Failure Logs

```bash
sudo journalctl -u kubelet -e --no-pager
```

### Step 3: Inspect Container Runtime

```bash
sudo systemctl status containerd
sudo journalctl -u containerd -e --no-pager
```

---

## 2. Interactive Break-Fix Drill

### Step 1: Break the Kubelet Configuration

```bash
sudo ./break-kubelet.sh
```

### Step 2: Investigate Failure Symptoms

Check service status and journal logs to locate the error:

```bash
sudo systemctl status kubelet
sudo journalctl -u kubelet -e --no-pager | grep -i "failed to run kubelet"
```

### Step 3: Restore Healthy State

```bash
sudo ./fix-kubelet.sh
```

